  concept: "Authored objective: Restore nanometre position feedback.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
    verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Position and speed feedback depend on sensor reference, signal ordering
    and calibration.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that
    this objective is complete."
